# SEO auto-update

Site: https://www.100cuci.ad. CMS: https://cms.100cuci.ad. Article HTML lives in `docs/cms-content-pack/articles/`. Push with `scripts/seo-auto-update.mjs` (body only). Do not copy 96mas.online paths or brand names.

Do not update randomly. Only the article slot that is due, or rows in `content/seo-queued-retry.json`. Do not change the homepage, hero, footer, or other pages.

1. `node scripts/seo-auto-update.mjs --select`
2. If it says not due and the retry file is empty, stop.
3. Rewrite only that article HTML. Keep the WordPress title, slug, and category unchanged. Use the printed next title as the single H1. If the line says `ready to push`, leave the HTML and run the updater. Never repeat a title in `content/seo-topic-log.json`.
4. `node scripts/seo-writing-check.mjs <file>`. If it fails, revise the same article until it passes. Do not skip or replace it.
5. `node scripts/seo-auto-update.mjs` pushes a passing body and sends Telegram.

Writing rules are enforced by `scripts/seo-writing-check.mjs`: one H1 and a lead paragraph; 4 or 5 H2 sections ending with "Frequently Asked Questions"; at least 3 FAQ H3 questions with an answer paragraph each; at least 6 H3 headings; at least 2 lists; a closing `<div class="lp-summary">`; 3 to 5 internal links; brand and product names are plain text, not anchor text; 18+, a fixed budget or bankroll, a time limit, do not chase losses, and a separate entertainment wallet; Malaysia and RM only. No guaranteed-win, risk-free, sure-win, or secret-system claims. Prefer the mobile browser. Do not push APK installs.

Pillars, in order: local payment and banking UX; game mechanics and math without promising winnings; mobile browser hygiene; responsible gaming and 18+.

Telegram pass: `✅ www.100cuci.ad 已更新 N 篇文章`

Telegram fail (different sentence): `❌ www.100cuci.ad 这轮文章没通过检查，正在修改，通过后才会更新。` Then the article, the first failed rule, and `这一轮不会跳过。`

A failed check stays in `content/seo-queued-retry.json`. The next run finishes it before a new topic.
